### Test 1 - Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/

### Test 2 - List all books
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books

### Test 3 - Search
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books?q=clean

### Test 4 - Limit
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books?limit=2

### Test 5 - Get one book
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/1

### Test 6 - Not found
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/999

### Test 7 - Create a book
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "JavaScript Everywhere",
    "author": "Adam D. Scott",
    "year": 2020
}

### List all books fresh
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Test 8 - Validation error
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Just a title"
}

### Test 9 - Update a book
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "year": 2009
}

### Test 10 - Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/books/2

### CORS preflight test
OPTIONS http://localhost:8000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST